1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:04,784
Playabachata is an affordable all-
inclusive on the Puerto Plata coast, and
guests

2
00:00:04,814 --> 00:00:09,036
keep praising its friendly staff, its
quiet beach and its evening shows.

3
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:13,558
It sits on Maimon Bay, an eight minute
walk from the Amber Cove cruise port.

4
00:00:13,688 --> 00:00:18,994
Expedia lists four stars, five hundred
forty-four rooms, and a guest score of 7.2

5
00:00:19,024 --> 00:00:22,025
out of 10 from more than two thousand
reviews.

6
00:00:22,155 --> 00:00:26,443
I will show you what you get, how to enjoy
it, and my honest score at the end.

7
00:00:26,573 --> 00:00:30,742
And stay for the reviews, because one
thing shows up in them more than anything

8
00:00:30,772 --> 00:00:31,008
else.

9
00:00:31,138 --> 00:00:32,248
First, the value.

10
00:00:32,378 --> 00:00:37,028
Meals, snacks and drinks are included, and
the free buffet breakfast runs from seven

11
00:00:37,058 --> 00:00:38,198
to ten every morning.

12
00:00:38,328 --> 00:00:41,473
I found no mandatory resort fee on the
Expedia page.

13
00:00:41,603 --> 00:00:45,820
That is a big reason it is so popular with
couples, friends and families on a

14
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:46,206
budget.

15
00:00:46,336 --> 00:00:50,709
The rooms are bright and clean, with air
conditioning, a ceiling fan, a safe and a

16
00:00:50,739 --> 00:00:52,481
minibar, and many have a balcony.

17
00:00:52,611 --> 00:00:55,864
If you can, ask for a beachside or
oceanfront room.

18
00:00:55,994 --> 00:00:56,840
Now, the beach.

19
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:01,793
It is a wide, golden beach lined with palm
trees, cabanas and sun loungers, with

20
00:01:01,823 --> 00:01:02,764
towels included.

21
00:01:02,894 --> 00:01:06,268
Play beach volleyball, try scuba diving,
or just do nothing.

22
00:01:06,398 --> 00:01:10,800
There are outdoor pools, a hot tub and a
beach bar, and guests say the beach and

23
00:01:10,830 --> 00:01:12,130
public areas stay clean.

24
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:13,166
Now, the food.

25
00:01:13,296 --> 00:01:17,507
Expedia lists three restaurants, five bars
and lounges, and a beach bar.

26
00:01:17,637 --> 00:01:22,072
There is a coffee shop, a gelato counter
and a pizza stand, shared with the Senator

27
00:01:22,102 --> 00:01:22,986
resort next door.

28
00:01:23,116 --> 00:01:25,737
Guests praise the omelette and pasta
stations.

29
00:01:25,867 --> 00:01:29,430
Opening hours for the restaurants and bars
are not published, so ask at the front

30
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:30,362
desk when you arrive.

31
00:01:30,492 --> 00:01:31,507
Now, the evenings.

32
00:01:31,637 --> 00:01:36,557
Expedia lists live shows and concerts, a
free daily manager's reception, and

33
00:01:36,587 --> 00:01:37,078
karaoke.

34
00:01:37,208 --> 00:01:41,431
The photos show fire dancers, costume
shows and a big theatre, and reviewers
single

35
00:01:41,461 --> 00:01:42,814
out the entertainment team.

36
00:01:42,944 --> 00:01:47,974
There is also a spa with massages, facials
and body scrubs, so book ahead, and a gym

37
00:01:48,004 --> 00:01:49,058
with yoga classes.

38
00:01:49,188 --> 00:01:50,409
Now, the location.

39
00:01:50,539 --> 00:01:55,176
Cofresi Beach is about nine minutes by
car, and Ocean World Adventure Park about

40
00:01:55,206 --> 00:01:55,584
eleven.

41
00:01:55,714 --> 00:01:58,679
The Puerto Plata airport is roughly fifty
minutes away.

42
00:01:58,809 --> 00:02:00,868
A few tips to enjoy it even more.

43
00:02:00,998 --> 00:02:05,715
Guests say the rooms are clean but dated,
and some have been renovated, so ask for a

44
00:02:05,745 --> 00:02:06,506
renovated one.

45
00:02:06,636 --> 00:02:10,764
The Wi-Fi is free in public areas, but
some guests find it weak in the rooms.

46
00:02:10,894 --> 00:02:15,321
Some guests want more food variety, so mix
the buffet with the coffee shop, the

47
00:02:15,351 --> 00:02:16,506
pizza and the gelato.

48
00:02:16,636 --> 00:02:21,176
There are no elevators, so ask for a
ground floor room if stairs are a problem.

49
00:02:21,306 --> 00:02:22,687
So, is it worth it?

50
00:02:22,817 --> 00:02:27,523
Seven hundred ninety-two of more than two
thousand reviews on Expedia are perfect

51
00:02:27,553 --> 00:02:27,815
tens.

52
00:02:27,945 --> 00:02:32,708
And that thing in the reviews? The staff.
Guests call them friendly, helpful and

53
00:02:32,738 --> 00:02:33,367
incredible.

54
00:02:33,497 --> 00:02:38,350
It is not a luxury resort, but for an
affordable all-inclusive with a good
beach, a

55
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:41,232
friendly team and shows at night, it makes
sense.

56
00:02:41,362 --> 00:02:45,120
My honest score: seven point five out of
ten, counting the price.

57
00:02:45,250 --> 00:02:50,840
Good for couples, friends and families on
a budget. The link is in the description.
